# =============================================================================
# NEXUS — root Docker build context exclusions.
# =============================================================================
# The compose services build with the contexts ./backend and ./frontend, and
# each of those directories has its own, stricter .dockerignore — those are the
# files that actually apply to `docker compose build`. This root file governs
# any build that uses the repository root as its context (a future
# all-in-one image, or `docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .`), and acts as a
# second line of defence so secrets and multi-gigabyte artefacts can never be
# picked up by accident.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets: never bake a real .env into an image --------------------------
.env
.env.*
# Last match wins, so this re-include is only effective while it stays *below*
# the `.env.*` exclusion above. Moving it up silently excludes .env.example too.
!.env.example

# --- VCS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Virtual environments and installed dependencies -----------------------
.venv
venv
env
ENV
**/.venv
node_modules
**/node_modules

# --- Build output ------------------------------------------------------------
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# --- Python caches and artefacts ---------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache

# --- Local runtime data ------------------------------------------------------
# A bind-mounted PostgreSQL data directory is 1+ GB of binary; nothing that big
# has any business in a build context.
pgdata
postgres-data
**/pgdata
**/postgres-data
.tmpchk

# --- Logs and scratch --------------------------------------------------------
logs
**/logs
*.log

# --- Tooling config not needed inside an image -------------------------------
.vscode
.idea
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/node_modules/.cache
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/.eslintcache
